    "detailed_description": "While traveling through space you have been captured by a malevolent god who curses you with a new element that can restrict your movements, just to place you in this game for his own amusement, while he collapses the universe around you and plans for you to be at the center of it.<br><br>You will need to escape but to do so you will need to complete levels giving him no choice but to think up more elaborate stages that will hopefully distract him enough to break free from his curse.<br><br>Completing each stage earns you a score based on time remaining, once you complete 4 and 8 stages you will hit a checkpoint that will keep your score and lives remaining while on that level and when you finish all 10 stages you will receive a star based on your total score.<br><br>\u2981 3 Difficulties to choose from: Easy, Normal and Hard.<br>\u2981 Highly recommend Easy or Normal as starting points.<br>\u2981 Use all the elements to conquer the stages and finish a level.<br>\u2981 Change elements simply by using the correct key or button.<br><br>\u2981 Roll or Jump through gates and earn more time to pass stages, some can be worth more.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/e16b95fa2b292c11778cf6c0de120abb.poster.avif?t=1727321577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/e16b95fa2b292c11778cf6c0de120abb.webm?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/e16b95fa2b292c11778cf6c0de120abb.mp4?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2981 Climb different element ramps only with the correct element to reach higher levels.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/d1511ffee8467ec6d5b2687a25b59c1d.poster.avif?t=1727321577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/d1511ffee8467ec6d5b2687a25b59c1d.webm?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/d1511ffee8467ec6d5b2687a25b59c1d.mp4?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2981 In later levels start using the cursed element to get through stages.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/35d15cff10211a746fe261b515286dd0.poster.avif?t=1727321577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/35d15cff10211a746fe261b515286dd0.webm?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/35d15cff10211a746fe261b515286dd0.mp4?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2981 Activate element colored jump platforms to reach much higher places.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/55e7f3ef76d5c99ef85f6d6c2bf5ba12.poster.avif?t=1727321577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/55e7f3ef76d5c99ef85f6d6c2bf5ba12.webm?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/55e7f3ef76d5c99ef85f6d6c2bf5ba12.mp4?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2981 Activate portals that move you around the stages and change your view.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/a5a45ee765eaf6a034a2ea0ce548b6af.poster.avif?t=1727321577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/a5a45ee765eaf6a034a2ea0ce548b6af.webm?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/a5a45ee765eaf6a034a2ea0ce548b6af.mp4?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2981 Destroy an elemental to gain additional points.<br>\u2981 Activate portals that move you around the stages and views.<br>\u2981 Reverse and restore gravity to avoid time sucking pools and more.<br>\u2981 Enter and Exit Zero G area's where you no longer roll but float.<br>\u2981 Earn points to obtain stars to pass levels and gain extra lives.<br>\u2981 Start on four 2D levels then move onto rolling through 2.5D stages.<br>\u2981 Each level has mirrored stages with its own set of difficulties.<br>\u2981 Change platform colors on all stages to something easier to see in game options.<br>\u2981 Featuring over 150 total stages that you can practice.<br>\u2981 and much more<br><br>Do your best to survive and escape.",
    "about_the_game": "While traveling through space you have been captured by a malevolent god who curses you with a new element that can restrict your movements, just to place you in this game for his own amusement, while he collapses the universe around you and plans for you to be at the center of it.<br><br>You will need to escape but to do so you will need to complete levels giving him no choice but to think up more elaborate stages that will hopefully distract him enough to break free from his curse.<br><br>Completing each stage earns you a score based on time remaining, once you complete 4 and 8 stages you will hit a checkpoint that will keep your score and lives remaining while on that level and when you finish all 10 stages you will receive a star based on your total score.<br><br>\u2981 3 Difficulties to choose from: Easy, Normal and Hard.<br>\u2981 Highly recommend Easy or Normal as starting points.<br>\u2981 Use all the elements to conquer the stages and finish a level.<br>\u2981 Change elements simply by using the correct key or button.<br><br>\u2981 Roll or Jump through gates and earn more time to pass stages, some can be worth more.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/e16b95fa2b292c11778cf6c0de120abb.poster.avif?t=1727321577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/e16b95fa2b292c11778cf6c0de120abb.webm?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/e16b95fa2b292c11778cf6c0de120abb.mp4?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2981 Climb different element ramps only with the correct element to reach higher levels.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/d1511ffee8467ec6d5b2687a25b59c1d.poster.avif?t=1727321577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/d1511ffee8467ec6d5b2687a25b59c1d.webm?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/d1511ffee8467ec6d5b2687a25b59c1d.mp4?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2981 In later levels start using the cursed element to get through stages.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/35d15cff10211a746fe261b515286dd0.poster.avif?t=1727321577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/35d15cff10211a746fe261b515286dd0.webm?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/35d15cff10211a746fe261b515286dd0.mp4?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2981 Activate element colored jump platforms to reach much higher places.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/55e7f3ef76d5c99ef85f6d6c2bf5ba12.poster.avif?t=1727321577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/55e7f3ef76d5c99ef85f6d6c2bf5ba12.webm?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/55e7f3ef76d5c99ef85f6d6c2bf5ba12.mp4?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2981 Activate portals that move you around the stages and change your view.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/a5a45ee765eaf6a034a2ea0ce548b6af.poster.avif?t=1727321577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/a5a45ee765eaf6a034a2ea0ce548b6af.webm?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1836740/extras/a5a45ee765eaf6a034a2ea0ce548b6af.mp4?t=1727321577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2981 Destroy an elemental to gain additional points.<br>\u2981 Activate portals that move you around the stages and views.<br>\u2981 Reverse and restore gravity to avoid time sucking pools and more.<br>\u2981 Enter and Exit Zero G area's where you no longer roll but float.<br>\u2981 Earn points to obtain stars to pass levels and gain extra lives.<br>\u2981 Start on four 2D levels then move onto rolling through 2.5D stages.<br>\u2981 Each level has mirrored stages with its own set of difficulties.<br>\u2981 Change platform colors on all stages to something easier to see in game options.<br>\u2981 Featuring over 150 total stages that you can practice.<br>\u2981 and much more<br><br>Do your best to survive and escape.",
    "short_description": "Elemgate is a unique precision platformer where you'll need to control your speed, changing of the elements and jump timing and to earn more time that converts into score needed to pass 10 stages per level and ultimately across 15 levels in this 2.5D obstacle course challenge to escape an evil god.",
